ent-Aquarium = aquarium
    .desc = A vivarium in which aquatic fauna and flora are usually kept and displayed.
ent-AquariumKit = DIY aquarium construction kit
    .desc = Everything you need to build your own aquarium. Raw materials sold separately.
ent-FishFeed = fish feed can
    .desc = A reusable can of nutritious fish feed.
ent-AquariumPropRocks = decorative rocks
    .desc = A bunch of tiny plastic rocks for decorating an aquarium.
ent-AquariumPropSeaweed = fake seaweed
    .desc = Little plastic sheets with weighted bottoms, designed to look like underwater foliage.
ent-AquariumPropSeaweedTop = artificial plants
    .desc = A bunch of artificial plants for the upper part of an aquarium.
ent-AquariumPropSand = aquarium sand
    .desc = A plastic board for lining the bottom of an aquarium.
ent-AquariumPropTreasure = tiny treasure chest
    .desc = A very small plastic treasure chest, with nothing inside.
ent-AquariumUpgradeBioelectric = aquarium bioelectricity kit
    .desc = All the required components to let an aquarium harness the energy of bioelectric fish.
ent-AquariumUpgradeBluespace = bluespace aquarium kit
    .desc = The required components to make an aquarium hold much more fish than physics allows.
